/// (frame_watch.pion's insts_said, @damage's frames compared), whichever window of the run made it (the host keeps one
/// table of them for all its windows: window_slots.pion).
// kept across runs: a group's number is never one a run before had
// moved to 00_init_order.pion: ride_groups_made

///|
